# Conversation history beyond the flash ring (40 records in simnet): the
# messages it overwrites go to the SD card archive, and scrolling up past
# the oldest loaded message brings them back, page by page. Down at the
# bottom of an older page loads newer ones; sending returns to the newest.
# Clear history removes ring and archive.
# both-modes
node Kim 8
repeat 70 1500 as Kim chan 0 m#
wait 3000
expect threads 1
# The screen slept and locked meanwhile (messages only flash the LED): G0 unlocks it.
key g0
key enter
# All 70 unread: it opens on the "New" line, at the start of history.
expect first m001
expect divider 24
# Read now: opened again, no line, and it is where it was left.
key esc
key enter
expect divider -1
expect window 24
key up 300
expect first m001
shot history-start
key up
shot history-start-toast
key down 300
expect last m070
type Back at the newest
key enter
wait 2000
expect last Back at the newest
shot history-newest
# Clear it from the channel's screen.
key tab
key down 3
key enter
key y
wait 500
expect threads 0
hold esc 900
key right 3
key enter
expect window 0
